---
// Hero Section
---

<section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[1400px] px-6 py-12 md:px-12 md:py-20 lg:px-20 lg:py-24">
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-12 lg:grid lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-20">
    <div
      class="order-1 flex flex-col items-center space-y-8 text-center lg:items-start lg:text-left"
    >
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="text-muted-foreground text-lg tracking-wider italic">Hola, soy</span>

        <h1 class="text-foreground font-serif text-4xl leading-tight uppercase lg:text-5xl">
          Christian Oller
        </h1>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
          <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Designer</h2>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              d="m8.464 15.535l7.072-7.07m-7.072 0l7.072 7.07"></path></svg
          >
          <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">Developer</h2>
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            ><path
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-width="1.5"
              d="m8.464 15.535l7.072-7.07m-7.072 0l7.072 7.07"></path></svg
          >
          <h2 class="text-foreground text-xl font-bold md:text-2xl">QA</h2>
        </div>

        <p
          class="text-muted-foreground mx-auto max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-pretty lg:mx-0"
        >
          Especializado en transformar ideas en experiencias digitales robustas y escalables.
          Combino la precisión técnica del desarrollo con la sensibilidad del diseño para crear
          productos que no solo funcionan, sino que destacan.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a
        href="/contact"
        class="bg-foreground text-background hover:bg-foreground/90 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full px-8 py-3 text-sm font-medium transition-transform hover:scale-105"
      >
        Contactar
        <svg
          xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
          width="16"
          height="16"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          stroke-width="2"
          stroke-linecap="round"
          stroke-linejoin="round"
          class="ml-2"
        >
          <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
          <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>

    <div class="order-2 flex w-full justify-center lg:justify-end">
      <div
        class="relative aspect-3/4 w-64 overflow-hidden rounded-3xl shadow-2xl md:w-80 lg:w-120 lg:rounded-[3rem]"
      >
        <img
          src="/images/profile.jpg"
          alt="Foto de perfil de Christian Oller"
          class="h-full w-full object-cover"
          loading="eager"
        />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
